--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialScene_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 100000000001
    m_Localized: "This is a picture of the past. It will help you reconstruct events and learn the truth."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000002
    m_Localized: "This is the spread zone. Here you can place cards from your hand."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000003
    m_Localized: "Since your spread was perfect. Both the required number and suit matched \u2014 you can see an additional hint."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000004
    m_Localized: "Excellent! Now I'll tell you how to make a spread to look into the past. See the magic ball? It changed color and revealed a number. Using cards you must fulfill the condition it indicates."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000005
    m_Localized: "Super! Look, the number of your spread matches the number in the ball. And the dominant suit of the cards matches the color of the ball. That means you did great!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000006
    m_Localized: "Take the second card of the <color=#387545>Coin</color> suit and place it in the spread zone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000007
    m_Localized: "Here is shown your current spread result. Simply make this number match the number\nin the magic ball."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000008
    m_Localized: "To make a spread and look into the past, you will need these cards \u2014 they read traces invisible to the eye."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000009
    m_Localized: "Allow me to introduce myself \u2014 Madame Quaking. My cards will tell not just your fortune, but a history hidden in the patterns."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000010
    m_Localized: "At any moment you can open the rules scroll to remember how everything works here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000011
    m_Localized: "Try placing this green card in the spread zone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000012
    m_Localized: "These are your cards. Each with its own value and suit \u2014 but more on that in a moment."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000013
    m_Localized: "Nice! As you can see the cards lit up \u2014 meaning the special rule for this suit's spread is met. Lit cards multiply their value by 2."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000014
    m_Localized: "And a final tip for the future: to get the required number, you don't always need to place a card in the ideal position. Good luck!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000015
    m_Localized: "Press the button to confirm your spread."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000016
    m_Localized: "coming soon"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000017
    m_Localized: "Make the correct spread and the true picture of the past will be revealed to you. Fulfill the condition of the crystal ball.\n\nThis first time I will help you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000018
    m_Localized: "Note that your spread can have a dominant suit \u2014 this will help you get an additional hint. The dominant suit is determined by the total of cards of different suits in the spread."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000019
    m_Localized: "Draw cards from the deck."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000020
    m_Localized: "Now about suits. There are 4 in the game: <color=#387545>Coin</color>, <color=#EB1C24>Rose</color>, <color=#ffbd00>Crown</color> and <color=#5691b4>Skull</color>. Each suit has a special property in the spread."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000021
    m_Localized: "Look in the rules scroll."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000022
    m_Localized: "Here is also a description of how cards of different suits work."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
